[desktop 5] 0.3s rep=0 Q: is it really free?
   A: Yes, GoAI.foo is completely free. There is no account, no sign-up and no paid API, because everything runs on your own device. Explore the tools →
[desktop 6] 0.3s rep=0 Q: do you upload my data to a server
   A: No, nothing is uploaded. GoAI.foo is local-first: tools, AI models and your projects all run and stay in your browser. Nothing you type or paste is sent to a server. Privacy policy →
[desktop 7] 0.3s rep=0 Q: Can I make a landing page?
   A: The Project Builder lets you make a website from a template (Business, E-commerce, Blog, Portfolio, Dashboard or Blank). You edit and reorder sections, preview it, and export a ZIP of plain HTML/CSS to host anywhere. Projects are saved locally in your browser.
[desktop 8] 0.3s rep=0 Q: how do I host the site I made
   A: Open the Project Builder, pick a template, then edit the text, images and sections and watch the live preview. When you are happy, export a ZIP and upload it to any static host. GoAI.foo itself does not host your site. Open Project Builder →
